message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite the original
  paper it implements (listed under references).
type: software
title: "Chebyshev-Wavelet-Core: operational matrices of integration and product for second-kind Chebyshev wavelets"
authors:
  - family-names: Kao
    given-names: En-Tsai
    alias: heinricitorgau
version: 1.0.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24285430
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.24285430
    description: Zenodo concept DOI (all versions; resolves to the latest)
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.24285431
    description: Zenodo DOI of version 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/heinricitorgau/Chebyshev-Wavelet-Core"
abstract: >-
  A MATLAB implementation of the operational matrix of integration (OMI) and
  the product operation matrix (POM) for second-kind Chebyshev wavelets,
  derived for arbitrary resolution k and order M, verified element-wise
  against Eq. (4.9) of Nigam and Alam (Tamkang Journal of Mathematics, 2026)
  with zero error, and cross-checked against Lean 4 proofs. Includes a case
  study applying the basis to real FX and ETF data with causal features and
  calibrated null tests.
keywords:
  - Chebyshev wavelets
  - operational matrix of integration
  - spectral methods
  - differential equations
  - numerical analysis
  - MATLAB
  - formal verification
  - financial time series
